  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RS! Sierra Leone Palm Oil</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to smallholder inclusive sustainable Palm Oil production and trade, in which workers in plantations and mills and smallholders under decent working conditions, forests and and rights are equally protected. The main objectives of the project are The target groups are Africa Palm Oil Initiative, producers association, cooperatives, women&apos;s groups, civil society groups. Objectives 1. To create, strengthen and/or join in dialogue to enhance access to knowledge, information and credible evidence, where vulnerable groups are included and policy makers can make informed decisions. 2. To strengthen the ability of civil society to claim and defend their rights and influence decision making 3. To mobilise activate and engage citizens and CSOs to change norms and influence the policy agenda for the range of issues highlighted in the problem analysis</narrative>
  </description>
